          "text": "This template demonstrates the report class configured for a typical graduate thesis. It features double line-spacing, a wider left margin for binding, and chapter-level sectioning (Heading 1 = \\chapter). The template showcases cross-references, citations, figures, tables, equations, algorithms, and appendices.",
